# A Windows checkout runs with core.autocrlf=true, and two tests assert on the
# bytes of tracked files: tools/sensitive-rules pins config/gitleaks/gitleaks.toml
# by SHA-256, and copypaste-ui's app-assembly tests `include_str!` their own
# lib.rs and split it on "\n#[cfg(test)]". CRLF fails both, and would fail them
# on any Windows machine, not only CI.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The one file that is read by cmd.exe.
*.bat text eol=crlf
